  "body": "If synapse cannot bind to a TCP socket, or there is an error in the listeners config, synapse exits with a zero exit code even if it is configured not to daemonize.\n\nIt looks like it doesn't actually exit when `sys.exit(1)` is called but rather does a bunch of cleanup and forgets the exit code in the meantime",
